   "start": 6.658250000000001,
   "end": 12.439333333333332
  },
  {
   "id": "brain",
   "text": "But your brain doesn't wait for that to build up. It speeds up your breathing from the very first step,",
   "voice_start": 12.499333333333333,
   "voice_end": 17.456583333333334,
   "caps": [
