     "text": "But your brain",
     "t0": 12.499333333333333,
     "t1": 13.183091954022988
    },
    {
     "text": "doesn't wait for",
     "t0": 13.183091954022988,
     "t1": 13.923830459770114
    },
    {
     "text": "that to build up.",
     "t0": 13.923830459770114,
     "t1": 14.835508620689655
    },
    {
     "text": "It speeds up",
     "t0": 14.835508620689655,
     "t1": 15.405307471264367
    },
    {
     "text": "your breathing from",
     "t0": 15.405307471264367,
