    },
    {
     "text": "lactic acid isn't",
     "t0": 35.465575102880656,
     "t1": 36.41639403292181
    },
    {
     "text": "the villain.",
     "t0": 36.41639403292181,
     "t1": 37.29929732510288
    },
    {
     "text": "Lactate is actually",
     "t0": 37.29929732510288,
     "t1": 38.453863168724276
    },
    {
     "text": "fuel for your",
     "t0": 38.453863168724276,
